abstract: "What you actually get as a file, what it costs, and what you are allowed to do with it. 9 tools that hand you a file, 7 that stream you a picture and give you none, 2 hosted wrappers and 2 announced but unavailable. Every figure and clause is quoted from the vendor's own page with the date it was read. No scores, no rankings, no comparison."
